2
00:07:33,333 --> 00:07:39,333
Elemental is a family, fantasy, comedy film directed by Peter Sohn.

3
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery young woman and a
go-with-the-flow guy will discover something elemental: how much they have in common.

4
00:15:06,666 --> 00:15:12,666
Ember (voice), played by Leah Lewis.

5
00:18:53,333 --> 00:18:59,333
Wade (voice), played by Mamoudou Athie.

6
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,000
Bernie (voice), played by Ronnie del Carmen.

7
00:26:26,666 --> 00:26:32,666
Cinder (voice), played by Shila Ommi.

8
00:30:13,333 --> 00:30:19,333
